N,G|               as they stare at him. Mark steps away, and the CAMERA PULLS 
N,G|               BACK with him.
O|
N|               We catch a glimpse of the house - large, sprawling, but 
N|               with a touch of quality about it, in a quiet, unpretentious 
N|               street.
O|
N|               Mark hurries towards a side entrance.
O|
