N,G|               REVERSE ANGLE SHOT of Mrs. Stephens.
O|
N,G|               Over Tony's shoulder WE SEE a powerfully built and once 
N|               lovely woman.
O|
N|               She is so perpetually drunk as almost to be sober. The few 
N|               movements she makes are slow - deliberate - and give nothing 
N|               away. The voice articulates so carefully that the slur 
N|               scarcely shows.
O|
